blocks.en:
Let $A\in\mathcal{L}(H)$ be compact. Show that there exist orthonormal sets $\{\psi_i\}_{i=1}^N$ and $\{\phi_i\}_{i=1}^N$ and positive real numbers $\{\lambda_i\}_{i=1}^N$ (here $N$ may be finite or infinite) such that
\begin{equation}\label{eq:compact-operator-singular-system-problem}
A(u)=\sum_{i=1}^N\lambda_i(\psi_i,u)\phi_i.
\end{equation}
Hint: $A^*A$ is compact and self-adjoint.

blocks.zh:
设 $A\in\mathcal{L}(H)$ 为紧算子. 证明存在标准正交集 $\{\psi_i\}_{i=1}^N$ 和 $\{\phi_i\}_{i=1}^N$, 以及正实数 $\{\lambda_i\}_{i=1}^N$ (这里 $N$ 可以有限, 也可以无穷), 使得
\begin{equation}\label{eq:compact-operator-singular-system-problem}
A(u)=\sum_{i=1}^N\lambda_i(\psi_i,u)\phi_i.
\end{equation}
Hint: $A^*A$ 为紧自伴随算子.

blocks.en:
Prove the following results due to F. Riesz. Let $S_1$ and $S_2$ be subspaces of a normed linear space. Suppose that $S_1$ is closed and that $S_1$ is a proper subset of $S_2$. Then for every $\theta\in(0,1)$ there is an $x\in S_2$ such that $\|x\|=1$ and
\begin{equation}\label{eq:riesz-subspace-separation-problem}
\|x-y\|\geq\theta\quad\text{for all }y\in S_1.
\end{equation}
Hint: Let $S_2\ni w\notin S_1$, and let $d=\operatorname{dist}(w,S_1)$. Show that there exists $v\in S_1$ such that
\begin{equation}\label{eq:riesz-subspace-separation-distance-hint}
d\leq\|w-v\|\leq\dfrac{d}{\theta}.
\end{equation}

blocks.zh:
证明以下由 F. Riesz 得到的结果. 设 $S_1$ 和 $S_2$ 为某赋范线性空间的子空间. 假设 $S_1$ 是闭的, 且 $S_1$ 为 $S_2$ 的真子集. 那么对每个 $\theta\in(0,1)$, 都存在 $x\in S_2$, 使得 $\|x\|=1$ 且
\begin{equation}\label{eq:riesz-subspace-separation-problem}
\|x-y\|\geq\theta\quad\text{for all }y\in S_1.
\end{equation}
Hint: 取 $S_2\ni w\notin S_1$, 并令 $d=\operatorname{dist}(w,S_1)$. 证明存在 $v\in S_1$, 使得
\begin{equation}\label{eq:riesz-subspace-separation-distance-hint}
d\leq\|w-v\|\leq\dfrac{d}{\theta}.
\end{equation}
